### Assign a user guest access to a squadron
POST {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/guest-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "role": "OPS"
}

### Change a user's role within their guest assignment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/guest-assignments/{{userId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "BASIC"
}

### Revoke a user's guest assignment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/squadrons/{{squadronId}}/guest-assignments/{{userId}}/revoke
